docs {
  # Proposal Final PDF API

  Endpoints untuk generate dan stream PDF final proposal penelitian/pengabdian.

  **Base URL:** `/api/proposal-final-pdf`

  ---

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Role |
  |--------|----------|-------------|------|------|
  | GET | `/user/:id` | Generate PDF (untuk Ketua Pengusul) | ✅ | Pemilik proposal |
  | GET | `/admin/:id` | Generate PDF (untuk Admin) | ✅ | Admin |

  ---

  ## Catatan

  - Response berupa stream PDF binary
  - PDF juga disimpan ke `uploads/proposal-final-pdf/` jika env `GENERATE_PDF_STREAM_AND_SERVER=true`
  - Endpoint `/user/:id` hanya bisa diakses oleh Ketua Pengusul proposal tersebut
  - Endpoint `/admin/:id` memerlukan role admin
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}
